rows.en:
"Gwegh!"
You could almost hear his thick lips ripping away, flesh and all.
Prying his mouth open with a strength you'd never believe came from a woman, Hirai poured the whole bowlful of needles into it.{p}

You want to get married soon, right?
That works out perfectly, then.
Hirai's really beautiful, too.{p}

Even if you say you don't want to get married, you can't stay like that your whole life.
...Right?
And Hirai's really beautiful, too.{p}

Hirai couldn't take it and ran away.
Without the slightest idea why Sato had said such a thing.
She was so mortified she couldn't stand it.{p}

"It's not like I'm going to kill you or anything..."
As she said it, a strange light gleamed in her eyes.
She started wandering in a daze again.{p}
